Redface 2 v0.4.0 — entering beta.

Redface 2 leaves alpha and opens its public beta channel (open testing).

Since alpha:
- Reworked [quote] / [quotemsg] rendering (distinct bare quote, headers).
- Large images now full-width and tappable, no more pixelation or slowness.
- [code] blocks wrap and show line numbers.

Report bugs via beta or GitHub.
